  Two independent finding tracks against `.aide/readme.aide`:
  (1) QA finding from the README rewrite — Quick Start npx command omits @latest
  (preserved from prior QA pass);
  (2) Alignment finding from /aide:align — the spec hardcodes a six-tool count
  and enumerates the tool roster, both of which contradict ancestor `src/.aide`
  and root `.aide/intent.aide` rules forbidding count-pinning and roster
